{"id": "section-body-27220", "title": "Autism Spectrum Disorder", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty-three", "blocks": [{"id": "body-27220", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Autism Spectrum Disorder", "runs": [{"text": "Autism"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Spectrum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Disorder"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "359"}}, {"id": "body-27222", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27223", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "DSM-5 states that an individual diagnosed with autism spectrum disorder would have marked difficulties in terms of communication and engagement with others across multiple social situations. These difficulties include:", "runs": [{"text": "DSM-5"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "states"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "an"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "individual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diagnosed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "autism"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "spectrum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "disorder"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "would"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "have"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "marked"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "difficulties"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "terms"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of communication and engagement with others across multiple social situations. These difficulties include:"}]}, {"id": "body-27224", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Difficulties with demonstrating appropriate behaviours in social contexts", "runs": [{"text": "Difficulties"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "demonstrating"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "appropriate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "behaviours"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "social"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "contexts"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27225", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Difficulties associated with non-verbal communications used for social interactions", "runs": [{"text": "Difficulties"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "associated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "non-verbal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "communications"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "social"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "interactions"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27226", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Difficulties associated with failure to initiate or adapt to social interactions", "runs": [{"text": "Difficulties"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "associated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "failure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "initiate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "adapt"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "social"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "interactions"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27227", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "In addition, the DSM-5 also requires the individuals to have characteristic repetitive behavioral patterns, such as repeated stereotypical movements or Highly ritualized behavioral patterns. DSM-5 criteria specified that these behaviours must have started since the early developmental period and has resulted in marked impairments in terms of functioning.", "runs": [{"text": "In addition, the DSM-5 also requires the individuals to have characteristic repetitive behavioral patterns, such as repeated stereotypical movements or Highly ritualized behavioral patterns. DSM-5 criteria specified that these behaviours must have started since the early developmental period and has resulted in marked impairments in terms of functioning."}]}, {"id": "body-27229", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Assessment", "runs": [{"text": "Assessment"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27230", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Detailed history from a caregiver and educational institutions.", "runs": [{"text": "Detailed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "history"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "from"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "caregiver"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "educational"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "institutions."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27231", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Vital signs and physical examination.", "runs": [{"text": "Vital"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "signs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "physical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "examination."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27232", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Suicide risk assessment.", "runs": [{"text": "Suicide"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "risk"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "assessment."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27232-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Note: Despite exhibiting symptoms since childhood, autism spectrum disorder can sometimes be initially diagnosed in adulthood.", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Despite"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "exhibiting"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "since"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "childhood,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "autism"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "spectrum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "disorder"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sometimes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "initially"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diagnosed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "adulthood."}]}, {"id": "body-27234", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27235", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Baseline lab Investigations: FBC, LFT, RFT, VDRL, RBS, BS for M.P.s, HIV, TFT, Pregnancy Test,", "runs": [{"text": "Baseline"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lab"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Investigations: FBC, LFT,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "RFT, VDRL, RBS, BS"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "M.P.s, HIV,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "TFT, Pregnancy"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Test,"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27236", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Specific test, e.g.(toxicology)", "runs": [{"text": "Specific"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "test,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "e.g.(toxicology)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27237", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Imaging (C.T. scan and MRI).", "runs": [{"text": "Imaging"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(C.T."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scan"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "MRI)."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27238", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Other investigations may be considered based on the patient’s presentation.", "runs": [{"text": "Other"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "investigations"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "considered"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "based"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient’s"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "presentation."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27239", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If a patient tests positive for any of the above tests, manage accordingly and refer where appropriate", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tests"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "positive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "any"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "above"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tests,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "manage"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "accordingly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "refer"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "where"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "appropriate"}]}, {"id": "body-27241", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management For children", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management For children"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27242", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Every pre-school child diagnosed with autism should have an individualized intervention plan that sets out the goals, type(s), frequency and intensity of intervention, in order to address particular developmental and educational needs", "runs": [{"text": "Every pre-school child diagnosed with autism should have an individualized intervention plan that sets out the goals, type(s), frequency and intensity of intervention, in order to address particular developmental and educational needs"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27243", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "An individualized intervention plan should consist of a variety of quality programs and activities. This includes attendance in comprehensive early intervention programs, programs targeting specific needs and also positive engagement with parents and/or caregivers", "runs": [{"text": "An"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "individualized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "intervention"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "plan"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "consist"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "variety"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "quality"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "programs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "activities."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "This"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "includes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "attendance in comprehensive early intervention programs, programs targeting specific needs and also positive engagement with parents and/or caregivers"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27244", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Alternative-augmentative communication systems may be recommended for pre-school children with autism because the expanded (spoken or written) communication may stimulate speech acquisition in non-verbal children and enhance expression in verbal children.", "runs": [{"text": "Alternative-augmentative communication systems may be recommended for pre-school children with autism because the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "expanded"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(spoken"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "written)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "communication"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stimulate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "speech"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "acquisition"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "non-verbal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "children"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "enhance expression in verbal children."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27245", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Visual strategies are useful interventions for children with autism because they offer visual support to communication, increase spontaneous imitation and socially communicative behaviour.", "runs": [{"text": "Visual strategies are useful interventions for children with autism because they offer visual support to communication, increase spontaneous imitation and socially communicative behaviour."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27246", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Social skills programmes depend on the functioning level of the preschool child with autism and may include:", "runs": [{"text": "Social"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skills"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "programmes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "depend"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "functioning"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "level"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "preschool"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "child"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "autism"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "include:"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27247", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Assessment and teaching of social skills interaction in natural settings.", "runs": [{"text": "Assessment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "teaching"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "social"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skills"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "interaction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "natural"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "settings."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27248", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Provision of structure, visual cues and predictability.", "runs": [{"text": "Provision"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "structure,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "visual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cues"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "predictability."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27249", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Making abstract concepts more “concrete”.", "runs": [{"text": "Making"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "abstract"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "concepts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "more"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "“concrete”."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27250", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Activities that enable purposeful and appropriate interaction with typically developing peers.", "runs": [{"text": "Activities"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "enable"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "purposeful"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "appropriate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "interaction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "typically"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "developing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "peers."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27251", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Goals focusing on fostering self-appreciation and self-esteem", "runs": [{"text": "Goals"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "focusing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fostering"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "self-appreciation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "self-"}, {"text": "esteem"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27253", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "For the parents", "runs": [{"text": "For"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "parents"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27254", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Parents and caregivers should be encouraged to discuss the need for practical emotional support. This enables information to be provided, referrals made and support services made available", "runs": [{"text": "Parents"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "caregivers"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "encouraged"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "discuss"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "need"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "practical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "emotional"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "support."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "This"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "enables information to be provided, referrals made and support services made available"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27255", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Parents and caregivers are recommended to consult appropriate professionals when considering educational placement for their child with autism", "runs": [{"text": "Parents"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "caregivers"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "recommended"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "consult"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "appropriate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "professionals"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "when"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "considering"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "educational"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "placement for their child with autism"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "334"}}, {"id": "body-27257", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27258", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "S: risperidone (PO). 0.5- 4 mg (For Tantrums, aggressive episodes, self-injurious behaviours, hyperactivity)", "runs": [{"text": "S:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "risperidone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "0.5-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "4"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(For"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Tantrums,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "aggressive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "episodes,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "self-injurious"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "behaviours,